# ZAICODE workspace root. The app source lives in zcode/ (its own git repo).
# This repo tracks only the workspace layer: launcher, docs, product contract.
# It also gives SAIPEN a git source identity, so `saipen status` hashes a few
# tracked files instead of walking ~70k build/smoke files on every call.
/zcode/
/.zaicode/
/.tools/
/.devhome/
*.log
/ZAICODE.exe
/ZAICODE.exe.old
